	*START-1		/OVER STARTUP ADDRESS

	RECOVR+1		/NO DIALOGUE USED

	*COMBOT			/OVER PDL PROTECTION POINTER

COMBOT,	NCOMEOUT+12		/ACCOUNT FOR MOVED COMMAND BUFFER
	*GONE+13		/OVER REFERENCE TO P4000

